{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/995310738673e92d1cc8ae01451f873b.avif?t=1772214213\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras_big/995310738673e92d1cc8ae01451f873b.webp?t=1772214213 width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>The victim hired you to solve his own murder. You have one day to do it\u2014over and over again.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/d156f775b49ef081ad2bc4cc16a3163d.poster.avif?t=1772214213\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/d156f775b49ef081ad2bc4cc16a3163d.webm?t=1772214213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/d156f775b49ef081ad2bc4cc16a3163d.mp4?t=1772214213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/c6cf18de998823e4ef39daab538d3601.avif?t=1772214213\" width=1048 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Time Loop: You have one day to solve the crime. Learn the schedules of 14 unique characters, spot their contradictions, and manipulate their routines. Keep your knowledge when the day resets and stay one step ahead of the killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/448ebee9a6c1197dcbae43defc8ba3f3.poster.avif?t=1772214213\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/448ebee9a6c1197dcbae43defc8ba3f3.webm?t=1772214213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/448ebee9a6c1197dcbae43defc8ba3f3.mp4?t=1772214213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/beac37cbaa5b94fa6cc100ac948a3270.avif?t=1772214213\" width=1048 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. Use your &quot;Thinking Board&quot; to link evidence, reconstruct the timeline, and accuse the culprit. Only pure logic will free you from the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/aecb8644923992ca8fd6292b7c3880d6.poster.avif?t=1772214213\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/aecb8644923992ca8fd6292b7c3880d6.webm?t=1772214213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/aecb8644923992ca8fd6292b7c3880d6.mp4?t=1772214213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/d22181514d329afc0cb554b68caa4798.avif?t=1772214213\" width=1048 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Living Literary World: Experience a satirical, witty, and dark adaptation of Brazil\u2019s legendary author, Machado de Assis. Your investigation takes you through a hand-drawn 1937 Rio de Janeiro that drips with style, sarcasm, and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/292211021bf9c2c1383d7a735fb91bf2.avif?t=1772214213\" width=1560 height=340 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2466900?t=1772214213","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/8be6a5e5b2d56a55f365d5bf0f32418bf2ec171f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772214213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/918931206a7909c16a87e83dd8ba55547743a29d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772214213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/918931206a7909c16a87e83dd8ba55547743a29d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772214213","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The Posthumous Investigation features discussions about murder, death, mental and physical illness and incorrect forms of treatment. Some characters drink and smoke. It's not graphic, but not recommended to children nonetheless."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2528440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras/995310738673e92d1cc8ae01451f873b.avif?t=1772214213\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466900/extras_big/995310738673e92d1cc8ae01451f873b.webp?t=177